Subject: [PATCH 01/17] Blacklist RTX Remix patches baseline

Snapshot of every bridge and Remix change the Splinter Cell Blacklist overhaul
depends on (shared bridge status, shader normal capture, scene stability,
per-frame telemetry recorder, skinned triangle gate pass). Until now these
existed only as uncommitted edits on top of upstream b81a7b5.

